        "narrative": "<p>Northern pike scales were taken, but not aged due to difficult reading. Bluegill and walleye are present in above average number; northern pike, white sucker, and black crappie are present in average numbers; rock bass and yellow perch are present in below average numbers. Largemouth bass were observed in 1980, but no in this assessment. </p>"
      },
      {
